      "title": "SOUTH TYROL: tessellated OSM drivable roads (~250m)",
      "description": "Drivable roads from OpenStreetMap over South Tyrol (IT) onto an hexagonal tessellation of ~250m. [Source: This metadata record was automatically extracted from the GeoNode portal eurac]",
